flowchart LR
 DESIGNER((Designer)) --> DRAW[Create and edit geometry]
 DESIGNER --> LAYER[Manage layers]
 DESIGNER --> PLANE[Create/select workplanes]
 DESIGNER --> SCRIPT[Run TCS commands]
 DESIGNER --> EXPORT[Export drawing]
 ADMIN((Admin)) --> ROLES[Manage access roles]
 ADMIN --> AUDIT[Review audit records]
 DRAW --> MODEL[(Drawing model)]
 PLANE --> MODEL
 SCRIPT --> SAFE[Restricted script API]
 EXPORT --> FORMAT[JSON and DXF adapters]